      "content": "hey, i have this really sharp pain in my lower right stomach area and i'm feeling kind of nauseous. i haven't really gone to the bathroom in a few days so i think i'm just super backed up. should i take some strong laxatives to help clear things out or maybe some antacids for the nausea? or should i just wait it out?",
